# Hostile Investigator: "When this creature enters, target opponent discards a card" and "Whenever one or more players discard
# one or more cards, investigate. This ability triggers only once each turn." On turn 1 its own enters discard (Bot2 picks the
# Plains) makes the first Clue, and Corrupt Court Official's discard the same turn makes none. On turn 3 another discard makes a
# second Clue: the limit is once each turn, not once. It watches the other player's discards too.

